  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With an array of integers `nums`, half of the integers in `nums` are **odd**, and the other half are **even**.\n\nSort the array so that whenever `nums[i]` is odd, `i` is **odd**, and whenever `nums[i]` is even, `i` is **even**.\n\nOutput *any answer array that satisfies this condition*.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [4,2,5,7]\nOutput: [4,5,2,7]\nExplanation: [4,7,2,5], [2,5,4,7], [2,7,4,5] would also have been accepted.\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [2,3]\nOutput: [2,3]\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `2 <= nums.length <= 2 * 104`\n* `nums.length` is even.\n* Half of the integers in `nums` are even.\n* `0 <= nums[i] <= 1000`\n\n**Follow Up:** Could you solve it in-place?",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
